            "title": "Skillet",
            "link_recipes": false,
            "text": "A $(thing)Skillet$() is a simple appliance, similar to the $(l:cooking/cooking_methods#copper_pot)Copper Pot$(), but lacking any fluid handling or attachments. Skillets support tool and bowl slots and perform simple meal assembly recipes. They do not \"cook\" items like a grill or top oven does."
