            "anchor": "baking_dish",
            "item": "tag:tfg:baking_dishes",
            "title": "Baking Dishes",
            "link_recipes": false,
            "text": "$(thing)Baking Dishes$() are not appliances in the typical sense. You cook recipes using them by first filling them with ingredients, sealing, picking them up, and then placing them in $(l:cooking/cooking_methods#fire_box_top_oven)Fire Box Top Ovens$(). When finished cooking the output items will be found inside the dish. If the recipe produces an output fluid, any excess input fluids will be void."
        },
